fluxecho.deck.well.tip=§3A light set into a hollow in the floor, shining upwards§r
tile.fluxecho.deck.panel.name=Wall Panel
fluxecho.deck.panel.tip=§3The walls of the modules: the Echo Archive's walls and roof are built of it§r
tile.fluxecho.deck.panel_lit.name=Lit Wall Panel
fluxecho.deck.panel_lit.tip=§3A wall panel with a seam of light: the pilasters and ribs of a wall§r
tile.fluxecho.deck.panel_dark.name=Dark Wainscot
fluxecho.deck.panel_dark.tip=§3The dark course along the foot of a wall§r
tile.fluxecho.deck.cornice.name=Light Cornice
fluxecho.deck.cornice.tip=§3The glowing band along the top of a wall§r
tile.fluxecho.deck.canvas.name=Canvas Panel
fluxecho.deck.canvas.tip=§3A wall panel of dark woven navy under a faint cyan grid§r\nA module's unit paints the item it keeps on its canvas (the Dual-foil Vault's painted walls)
tile.fluxecho.fitting.post.name=Shelf Post
fluxecho.fitting.post.tip=§3A bookcase part: the upright between two bookcases§r
tile.fluxecho.fitting.plinth.name=Shelf Plinth
fluxecho.fitting.plinth.tip=§3A bookcase part: its foot, with three Echo Shelves stacked on it and a crown on top§r
tile.fluxecho.fitting.crown.name=Shelf Crown
fluxecho.fitting.crown.tip=§3A bookcase part: the top of a bookcase§r
tile.fluxecho.fitting.rail.name=Gallery Rail
fluxecho.fitting.rail.tip=§3The railing along the upper gallery§r
