fluxecho.research.node.anchor=Anchoring
fluxecho.research.node.anchor.desc=If we cannot go back, we anchor first. | Done by itself the first time a nexus forms; opens the manifestation table.
fluxecho.research.node.inner_ring=Keel
fluxecho.research.node.inner_ring.desc=Evenstar remembers where every cabin goes. | Draws eight sites round the nexus; a phase I campus opens the 3 hall sites among them.
fluxecho.research.node.phase_2=Phase II
fluxecho.research.node.phase_2.desc=The nexus grows its second stage and another ring rises. | All 8 sites round the nexus open, and the zenith takes the Echo Dome Generator.
fluxecho.research.node.echo_crystal=Echo Crystallization
fluxecho.research.node.echo_crystal.desc=One thing this world remembers for you, pressed into a crystal. | The table presses a codex entry into a flux crystal; each entry once a day.
fluxecho.research.node.library=Echo Archive
fluxecho.research.node.library.desc=The log cabin: what this world remembers for you, made into books. | Builds the Echo Archive on a hall site; opens manifesting its core and index cards.
fluxecho.research.node.library_reach=Lending Across Worlds
fluxecho.research.node.library_reach.desc=The books lend past the edge of this shore. | The archive lends its samples to echo machines in other dimensions.
fluxecho.research.node.eco_dome=Eco Dome
fluxecho.research.node.eco_dome.desc=The life cabin: a greenhouse that keeps seeds for the ship. | Builds the Eco Dome on a hall site; its planters keep the team's bees, trees, butterflies and crops.
fluxecho.research.node.compute_1=Compute Calibration
fluxecho.research.node.compute_1.desc=Evenstar thinks a little faster. | The nexus makes 50%% more compute.
fluxecho.research.node.upkeep_1=Throttling
fluxecho.research.node.upkeep_1.desc=A ship burns its fire sparingly. | The nexus's upkeep drops by 25%%.
fluxecho.research.node.tidal_well=Tidal Well
fluxecho.research.node.tidal_well.desc=The engine room: the tide is the pull of the far side. | Sinks the Tidal Well under the nexus; its eight tide taps keep the team's samples.
fluxecho.research.node.grit_yield=Grit Enrichment
fluxecho.research.node.grit_yield.desc=Teaches the collectors to know the ship's ash. | The team's shard collectors give off 50%% more flux grit.
fluxecho.research.node.dome=Echo Dome
fluxecho.research.node.dome.desc=The hull: the city's bounds are drawn from here. | The Echo Dome Generator at the zenith raises a shield: no spawns, no explosions, no projectiles.
fluxecho.research.node.arcane_court=Arcane Court
fluxecho.research.node.arcane_court.desc=The law of reason: aspects are another world's letters for matter. | Builds the Arcane Court on a pavilion site; it keeps the team's thaumic samples.
fluxecho.research.node.blood_covenant=Blood Covenant Altar
fluxecho.research.node.blood_covenant.desc=The law of the pact: blood is the signature of who you are. | Builds the Blood Covenant Altar on a pavilion site; it keeps the team's blood magic samples.
fluxecho.research.node.hunting_ground=Echo Hunting Ground
fluxecho.research.node.hunting_ground.desc=The law of the wild: this shore's monsters drifted in too. | Builds the Echo Hunting Ground on a pavilion site; its consoles keep the team's mob imprints.
fluxecho.research.node.mana_fountain=Mana Fountain Array
fluxecho.research.node.mana_fountain.desc=The law of life: a root of the world tree reaching this shore. | Builds the Mana Fountain Array on a pavilion site; it keeps the team's Botania samples.
fluxecho.research.node.resonance_gate=Resonance Gate
fluxecho.research.node.resonance_gate.desc=The bow: the city's gate, and its tuning fork. | Builds the Resonance Gate on the gate site; its columns and racks keep the team's samples.
fluxecho.research.node.dual_foil_vault=Dual-foil Vault
fluxecho.research.node.dual_foil_vault.desc=The cargo hold: one dimension, folded into a sheet. | Builds the Dual-foil Vault on a hall site; each canvas and the foil keep one kind of item.
fluxecho.research.node.phase_3=Phase III
fluxecho.research.node.phase_3.desc=The nexus grows its third stage. | With the Outer Hull researched, the outer diagonals take the Sophon Array and the Holo Sand Table.
fluxecho.research.node.outer_ring=Outer Hull
fluxecho.research.node.outer_ring.desc=The city grows its sides. | Grades a ring round the inner city, paves its streets, promenade and outer gate, and opens the four outer diagonals.
fluxecho.research.node.sophon_array=Sophon Array
fluxecho.research.node.sophon_array.desc=The ship's brain: Evenstar's second mind. | Builds the Sophon Array on an outer diagonal; a nexus of phase III or later can manifest manifest matter.
fluxecho.research.node.holo_table=Holo Sand Table
fluxecho.research.node.holo_table.desc=The bridge: the whole ship at a glance. | Builds the Holo Sand Table on an outer diagonal; the city turns as a hologram on its table.
fluxecho.research.node.phase_4=Phase IV
fluxecho.research.node.phase_4.desc=The nexus grows its fourth stage. | With the Mast researched the pod floats and four sky platforms are built; the Deep Root can grow under the well.
fluxecho.research.node.sky_ring=Mast
fluxecho.research.node.sky_ring.desc=The ship raises its mast. | The pod lets go of its legs and floats, four platforms join it by catwalks; opens manifesting the anti-gravity lattice.
fluxecho.research.node.weather_station=Weather Station
fluxecho.research.node.weather_station.desc=The weather: it picks the night you put to sea. | Builds the Weather Station on a sky platform; its four consoles keep the team's samples.
fluxecho.research.node.sky_sails=Sky Sail Array
fluxecho.research.node.sky_sails.desc=The sails: they catch the light the sea folds upward. | Builds the Sky Sail Array on a sky platform; each mast keeps a sail.
fluxecho.research.node.observatory=Observatory
fluxecho.research.node.observatory.desc=The lookout: a ship must see before it can go. | Builds the Observatory on a sky platform; its seven lens cases keep the team's samples.
fluxecho.research.node.droplet_hangar=Droplet Hangar
fluxecho.research.node.droplet_hangar.desc=The escort: eight mirror droplets keep the deck. | Builds the Droplet Hangar on a sky platform; each cradle keeps a droplet.
fluxecho.research.node.deep_root=Deep Root
fluxecho.research.node.deep_root.desc=The anchor chain goes down, and further down. | The Tidal Well grows into the Deep Root: a root chamber under it where there is room, inside it where not.
